A change log to document all changes made to the principal code

1.1:
  -#- Separation of modes into separate, dedicated files for each one.
  -#- Elimination of the PID system and all functions derived from it.
  -#- Code simplification and transition to a bang-bang control method for the first method.
  -#- upgrade to a Dead Reckoning method for the implementation of the second mode.

1.1.1:
  -#- New instructions for the second mode 
  -#- Minor adjustments for improved performance in the second mode
